    "detailed_description": "You are the manager of a football club, determine its future by making the best decisions regarding tactics, training, player contracts, sponsorship deals and infrastructure.<br><br>Start at the 4th division, use your management skills to fight your way up to the top.<br><br>All CPU matches are actually played, there is no made up result.<br><br>Watch your players performing on our amazing 2D match engine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>STRATEGY</strong>: Decide the best strategy for your club by choosing from 50 different formations and setting up individual instructions and team instructions.<br></li><li> <strong>TRAINING</strong>: hire training staff,  train your players in one of the 30 different attributes and manage players condition, morale and fitness to get the best of them;<br></li><li> <strong>FINANCES</strong>: Manage player contracts, accept sponsorship deals and loans.<br></li><li> <strong>TRANSFER MARKET</strong>: Put the players you don\u2019t like up for sale, and buy players who best fit your goals.<br></li><li> <strong>DEVELOPMENT</strong>: Expand your stadium, upgrade gym, training ground and recovery center.</li></ul>",
